# Response headers for every static asset of the ward console (Cloudflare Pages
# `_headers`; R-2026-09-24-88 BP-10, PR 3.4b-app B). tests/compliance/security_headers.test.ts
# holds this file to its rule. connect-src is 'self' plus THE BUILD TARGET'S API origin from
# packages/origins/origins.json, plus, since R-2026-10-02-FF FF-4 g (-182), THE SAME
# TARGET'S DIRECT SUPABASE ORIGIN: the ward console falls back to it when the Worker at the API
# origin is down or refuses a path (D5, R-2026-09-19-23; packages/auth/src/fallback.ts), and a
# browser may not fetch an origin its CSP does not name. `npm run build`, which is what is
# deployed, names the production API origin and the production direct origin; `npm run build:local`,
# for a local `wrangler pages dev`, names the local API origin only, because locally the two are the
# same address and the renderer drops the second.
# THE OLD TEXT, kept (2026-09-25): "connect-src is 'self' plus exactly THE BUILD TARGET'S API
# origin from packages/origins/origins.json ... and never the direct *.supabase.co origin."
# That last clause was true until D5's fallback and is not true of this app now. Admin's file
# still says it, and still means it: admin has no fallback.
# The emailed sign-in link is a navigation, which
# connect-src does not govern: it opens on api.openbed.ng since R-2026-09-30-177 (W3,
# option T1), and opened on the direct *.supabase.co origin until then. Until 2026-09-25 this read "the API origins
# origins.json gives apiOrigin() -- production and local, because the origin is chosen
# at run time by hostname", and every build named both. Runtime selection by hostname
# is unchanged; this is the header, not the bundle.
# The origins are NOT typed here (R-2026-09-24-94 BV-2): the two placeholders in connect-src
# are filled from origins.json by scripts/render_headers.mjs --target when the app is built.
# Referrer-Policy no-referrer: the sign-in lands with tokens in the URL fragment.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' @API_ORIGINS@ @FALLBACK_ORIGIN@; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
